From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 09:45:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/39] G4 cont4 checkpoints 1.5-1.6 (cont.): two duplication
 pairs removed

- The exit-normalizing adapter proves its set equality by an auto-param, so the composite rows
  no longer repeat that proof (one 90% in-file pair).
- The whole-layout bridge bounds each field by the layouts' own offset equations; the
  field-bound helper, which reproduced half of the catalog's field lemma, is removed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0155fKrzMUhziJHzQxJacYbw
